               role = c("aut"),
               email = "wilke@data-connection.de")
    )
Description: An R package to make data adjustments ("Datenanpassungen" in German) with predefined command blocks in Excel files. SPSS & Stata data sets are loaded and their variables can be manipulated from Excel files. These are auto-generated based on a template and containing information of the dataset's variables.
